<hr data-start="173" data-end="176">
<h2 data-section-id="10sxn81" data-start="178" data-end="227">🚀 Fastest way to get your website live (FREE)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="stellc" data-start="229" data-end="267">Option 1 (BEST &amp; easiest): Netlify</h3>
<p data-start="268" data-end="362">👉 Go here:<br data-start="279" data-end="282">
<strong data-start="282" data-end="362"><a data-start="284" data-end="360" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://www.netlify.com/with/react/?utm_source=chatgpt.com">Launch Netlify<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1clgjem" data-start="364" data-end="380">What you do:</h3>
<ol data-start="381" data-end="529">
<li data-section-id="szhgsj" data-start="381" data-end="408">
<p data-start="384" data-end="408">Click <strong data-start="390" data-end="408">“Add new site”</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="brbd5t" data-start="409" data-end="440">
<p data-start="412" data-end="440">Choose <strong data-start="419" data-end="440">“Deploy manually”</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1g2bgkb" data-start="441" data-end="493">
<p data-start="444" data-end="493">Drag your website <strong data-start="462" data-end="478">build folder</strong> into Netlify</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gcnmbb" data-start="494" data-end="529">
<p data-start="497" data-end="529">Boom — you get a live link like:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="530" data-end="573"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>https://chef-daddy-rays.netlify.app</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="575" data-end="703">Netlify can auto-deploy your site every time you update it, making it super easy to manage <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 82px;"><a href="https://dev.to/alex_aslam/how-to-deploy-react-vue-and-angular-apps-on-vercel-netlify-github-pages-i3c?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://dev.to/alex_aslam/how-to-deploy-react-vue-and-angular-apps-on-vercel-netlify-github-pages-i3c?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 82px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">DEV Community</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
<hr data-start="705" data-end="708">
<h2 data-section-id="7s4hhb" data-start="710" data-end="745">⚡ Even easier (no coding skills)</h2>
<p data-start="747" data-end="766">If you want, I can:</p>
<ul data-start="767" data-end="927">
<li data-section-id="wtynl" data-start="767" data-end="813">
<p data-start="769" data-end="813">Convert this into a <strong data-start="789" data-end="813">ready-to-upload file</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ymu0sd" data-start="814" data-end="869">
<p data-start="816" data-end="869">Or give you a <strong data-start="830" data-end="869">zip file you just drag into Netlify</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="136vizk" data-start="870" data-end="927">
<p data-start="872" data-end="927">Or even set it up so you only edit your menu like a doc</p>
</li>
</ul>
