 flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h4&gt;</span><span>Philly Cheesesteak</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h4&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;span</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">class</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"price"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>$13</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/span&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<ol start="4" data-start="985" data-end="1055">
<li data-section-id="1nzvx8h" data-start="985" data-end="1001">
<p data-start="988" data-end="1001">Save the file</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ub2w2h" data-start="1003" data-end="1055">
<p data-start="1006" data-end="1055">Drag the folder back into Netlify again to update</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1057" data-end="1060">
<h1 data-section-id="1uhnosp" data-start="1062" data-end="1095">🔄 How to UPDATE your live site</h1>
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1124">Every time you make changes:</p>
<p data-start="1126" data-end="1211">👉 Just re-upload the folder to Netlify<br data-start="1165" data-end="1168">
(it automatically replaces the old version)</p>
<hr data-start="1213" data-end="1216">
<h1 data-section-id="13r5bxo" data-start="1218" data-end="1252">🔥 Pro tip (for your food truck)</h1>
<p data-start="1253" data-end="1285">Since you’ll update menus often:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="nbstxy" data-start="1287" data-end="1306">Smart workflow:</h3>
<ul data-start="1307" data-end="1436">
<li data-section-id="d4a7x8" data-start="1307" data-end="1342">
<p data-start="1309" data-end="1342">Keep <code data-start="1314" data-end="1326">index.html</code> on your desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j32udc" data-start="1343" data-end="1370">
<p data-start="1345" data-end="1370">Edit prices/items anytime</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pbaylw" data-start="1371" data-end="1396">
<p data-start="1373" data-end="1396">Re-upload in 10 seconds</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1g9g2hq" data-start="1397" data-end="1436">
<p data-start="1399" data-end="1436">Your QR code always shows latest menu</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1438" data-end="1441">
<h1 data-section-id="mfnifk" data-start="1443" data-end="1475">💡 Want something even easier?</h1>
<p data-start="1476" data-end="1506">Right now you’re editing code.</p>
<p data-start="1508" data-end="1529">I can upgrade you to:</p>
<ul data-start="1530" data-end="1633">
<li data-section-id="12en39v" data-start="1530" data-end="1566">
<p data-start="1532" data-end="1566">🟢 Edit menu like a <strong data-start="1552" data-end="1566">Google Doc</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14pvs3c" data-start="1567" data-end="1601">
<p data-start="1569" data-end="1601">🟢 Click buttons instead of code</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1twl7yg" data-start="1602" data-end="1633">
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1633">🟢 Auto-update your live site</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1635" data-end="1682">Just say:<br>
👉 “make it editable like a menu app”</p>
<hr data-start="1684" data-end="1687">
<h1 data-section-id="17kvl1z" data-start="1689" data-end="1705">👍 Bottom line</h1>
<ul data-start="1706" data-end="1791">
<li data-section-id="n0vrke" data-start="1706" data-end="1744">
<p data-start="1708" data-end="1744">You <strong data-start="1712" data-end="1744">don’t need to build anything</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hwb5o4" data-start="1745" data-end="1779">
<p data-start="1747" data-end="1779">Just <strong data-start="1752" data-end="1779">edit → save → re-upload</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bp4rva" data-start="1780" data-end="1791">
<p data-start="1782" data-end="1791">That’s it</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1793" data-end="1796">
