<hr data-start="912" data-end="915">
<h2 data-section-id="1rqt01e" data-start="917" data-end="940">🚀 Push updates live</h2>
<p data-start="941" data-end="954">After saving:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1hm2yh3" data-start="956" data-end="978">Option A (fastest)</h3>
<ol data-start="979" data-end="1082">
<li data-section-id="jn1i61" data-start="979" data-end="1012">
<p data-start="982" data-end="1012">Go to your Netlify dashboard</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9vx8cc" data-start="1013" data-end="1046">
<p data-start="1016" data-end="1046">Drag the <strong data-start="1025" data-end="1046">same folder again</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="domzqx" data-start="1047" data-end="1082">
<p data-start="1050" data-end="1082">It overwrites the site instantly</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1084" data-end="1087">
<h3 data-section-id="1hka3sv" data-start="1089" data-end="1118">Option B (inside Netlify)</h3>
<ol data-start="1119" data-end="1214">
<li data-section-id="1yubtv7" data-start="1119" data-end="1139">
<p data-start="1122" data-end="1139">Go to your site</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ijesa7" data-start="1140" data-end="1162">
<p data-start="1143" data-end="1162">Click <strong data-start="1149" data-end="1160">Deploys</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b81ulb" data-start="1163" data-end="1193">
<p data-start="1166" data-end="1193">Click <strong data-start="1172" data-end="1191">“Upload deploy”</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="j1m1ar" data-start="1194" data-end="1214">
<p data-start="1197" data-end="1214">Upload the folder</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1216" data-end="1219">
<h1 data-section-id="i0vm75" data-start="1221" data-end="1256">🚨 Why you don’t see edit options</h1>
<ul data-start="1257" data-end="1389">
<li data-section-id="18s362r" data-start="1257" data-end="1301">
<p data-start="1259" data-end="1301">You used <strong data-start="1268" data-end="1299">manual deploy (drag &amp; drop)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vjp6bt" data-start="1302" data-end="1349">
<p data-start="1304" data-end="1349">Netlify treats it as a <strong data-start="1327" data-end="1349">static upload only</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1oqjzd8" data-start="1350" data-end="1389">
<p data-start="1352" data-end="1389">No built-in editor unless you use Git</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1391" data-end="1394">
<h1 data-section-id="xiav4q" data-start="1396" data-end="1447">🔥 My honest recommendation (for your food truck)</h1>
<p data-start="1449" data-end="1519">Right now:<br>
👉 This works, but it’s not ideal for frequent menu changes</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1lg5t3f" data-start="1521" data-end="1538">Better setup:</h3>
<p data-start="1539" data-end="1560">I can upgrade you to:</p>
<ul data-start="1561" data-end="1702">
<li data-section-id="14y0wo9" data-start="1561" data-end="1601">
<p data-start="1563" data-end="1601">🟢 Edit menu like a <strong data-start="1583" data-end="1601">form (no code)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1vbee31" data-start="1602" data-end="1629">
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1629">🟢 Click to update prices</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14ivi9y" data-start="1630" data-end="1671">
<p data-start="1632" data-end="1671">🟢 Auto-update your live site instantly</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16chjw1" data-start="1672" data-end="1702">
<p data-start="1674" data-end="1702">🟢 Perfect for QR code menus</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1704" data-end="1707">
<h1 data-section-id="1vxvrfj" data-start="1709" data-end="1727">👍 Quick summary</h1>
<ul data-start="1728" data-end="1872">
<li data-section-id="1bsg0xe" data-start="1728" data-end="1763">
<p data-start="1730" data-end="1763">You’re not doing anything wrong</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ouxva7" data-start="1764" data-end="1816">
<p data-start="1766" data-end="1816">Netlify just doesn’t allow editing in your setup</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qmmp86" data-start="1817" data-end="1872">
<p data-start="1819" data-end="1872">Your workflow is:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="1840" data-end="1872">Edit file → Save → Re-upload</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1874" data-end="1877">
<p data-start="1879" data-end="1980">If you want the next level (WAY easier long-term), say:<br>
