<h2 data-section-id="567dxq" data-start="93" data-end="129">💥 The REAL issue (plain English)</h2>
<p data-start="130" data-end="154">You’re uploading either:</p>
<ul data-start="155" data-end="242">
<li data-section-id="1mzw5og" data-start="155" data-end="186">
<p data-start="157" data-end="186">the <strong data-start="161" data-end="182">ZIP file directly</strong> ❌</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="17zdgox" data-start="187" data-end="242">
<p data-start="189" data-end="242">or a folder that has <strong data-start="210" data-end="238">another folder inside it</strong> ❌</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="244" data-end="299">So Netlify can’t find:<br>
👉 <code data-start="270" data-end="282">index.html</code> at the top level</p>
<hr data-start="301" data-end="304">
<h1 data-section-id="ac8git" data-start="306" data-end="355">✅ Let’s fix this the RIGHT way (takes 1 minute)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="2vuy1e" data-start="357" data-end="387">🔍 Step 1 — Open your files</h2>
<p data-start="388" data-end="413">Go to your Downloads and:</p>
<ol data-start="415" data-end="493">
<li data-section-id="sth50j" data-start="415" data-end="439">
<p data-start="418" data-end="439">Right-click the ZIP</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="abe8hn" data-start="440" data-end="464">
<p data-start="443" data-end="464">Click <strong data-start="449" data-end="464">Extract All</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="jezvdb" data-start="465" data-end="493">
<p data-start="468" data-end="493">Open the extracted folder</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="495" data-end="498">
<h2 data-section-id="1ici6r0" data-start="500" data-end="535">🔥 Step 2 — THIS is the key part</h2>
<p data-start="537" data-end="578">Keep clicking into folders until you see:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="580" data-end="610"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="612" data-end="643">👉 When you see that file, STOP</p>
<hr data-start="645" data-end="648">
<h2 data-section-id="1ocj78u" data-start="650" data-end="691">📦 Step 3 — Rebuild your upload folder</h2>
<ol data-start="693" data-end="856">
<li data-section-id="1aip4t0" data-start="693" data-end="780">
<p data-start="696" data-end="729">Select EVERYTHING in that folder:</p>
<ul data-start="733" data-end="780">
<li data-section-id="1ddbzt1" data-start="733" data-end="747">
<p data-start="735" data-end="747"><code data-start="735" data-end="747">index.html</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wfzmgi" data-start="751" data-end="761">
<p data-start="753" data-end="761"><code data-start="753" data-end="761">README</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="zppahp" data-start="765" data-end="780">
<p data-start="767" data-end="780">anything else</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9q7k3x" data-start="782" data-end="807">
<p data-start="785" data-end="807">Right-click → <strong data-start="799" data-end="807">Copy</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bnmnag" data-start="809" data-end="832">
<p data-start="812" data-end="832">Go to your Desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12v5nai" data-start="833" data-end="856">
<p data-start="836" data-end="856">Create a new folder:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="857" data-end="888"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>upload-this</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<ol start="5" data-start="890" data-end="926">
