<p data-start="178" data-end="220">Let’s fix this the easiest way possible 👇</p>
<hr data-start="222" data-end="225">
<h1 data-section-id="1n3h4ee" data-start="227" data-end="263">🚀 ✅ EASIEST FIX (no unzip needed)</h1>
<p data-start="265" data-end="313">I’m going to bypass the whole zip/unzip problem.</p>
<h2 data-section-id="2hwm3q" data-start="315" data-end="329">👉 Do this:</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw5" data-start="331" data-end="341">Step 1</h3>
<p data-start="342" data-end="432">Click this file:<br data-start="358" data-end="361">
👉 <span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">Download index.html only</button></span></p>
