</li>
<li data-section-id="fiv3oy" data-start="824" data-end="864">
<p data-start="826" data-end="864">Netlify immediately finds <code data-start="852" data-end="864">index.html</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6ezp4k" data-start="865" data-end="896">
<p data-start="867" data-end="896">Your site goes live instantly</p>
</li>
</ul>
