<hr data-start="110" data-end="113">
<h1 data-section-id="5ip3e4" data-start="115" data-end="154">🚀 STEP-BY-STEP (NO DOWNLOADS NEEDED)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1qbaofv" data-start="156" data-end="195">🟢 Step 1 — Create the file yourself</h2>
<ol data-start="197" data-end="262">
<li data-section-id="1ho3x17" data-start="197" data-end="229">
<p data-start="200" data-end="229">Right-click on your Desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xg3l57" data-start="230" data-end="262">
<p data-start="233" data-end="262">Click <strong data-start="239" data-end="262">New → Text Document</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="264" data-end="275">You’ll see:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="276" data-end="305"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>New Text Document.txt</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="307" data-end="310">
<h2 data-section-id="12a5pfn" data-start="312" data-end="336">🟢 Step 2 — Rename it</h2>
<ol data-start="338" data-end="385">
<li data-section-id="1shx0ee" data-start="338" data-end="368">
<p data-start="341" data-end="368">Right-click it → <strong data-start="358" data-end="368">Rename</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10453nn" data-start="369" data-end="385">
<p data-start="372" data-end="385">Change it to:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="387" data-end="405"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="407" data-end="454">⚠️ IMPORTANT:<br>
If it still says <code data-start="438" data-end="444">.txt</code>, do this:</p>
<ul data-start="455" data-end="558">
<li data-section-id="1cpv6wu" data-start="455" data-end="487">
<p data-start="457" data-end="487">Click <strong data-start="463" data-end="471">View</strong> (top of folder)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="f1jn7j" data-start="488" data-end="522">
<p data-start="490" data-end="522">Turn ON <strong data-start="498" data-end="522">File name extensions</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="groj6h" data-start="523" data-end="558">
<p data-start="525" data-end="558">Then rename again to <code data-start="546" data-end="558">index.html</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="560" data-end="563">
<h2 data-section-id="nrz51h" data-start="565" data-end="599">🟢 Step 3 — Open and paste this</h2>
<p data-start="601" data-end="636">Right-click → <strong data-start="615" data-end="636">Open with Notepad</strong></p>
<p data-start="638" data-end="680">Delete everything inside, then paste this:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="682" data-end="986"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>HTML</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="btn relative group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-width:1.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-offset:2.5px] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-style:solid] group-focus-within/dialog:focus-visible:[outline-color:var(--text-primary)] btn-ghost size-9" aria-label="Edit"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-label="" class="-mx-1 icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></div></button></span><div aria-label="Toggle view" class="group relative flex gap-0.5 rounded-full p-0.5 bg-token-bg-secondary dark:bg-gray-1000"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-token-bg-primary pointer-events-none absolute start-0.5 top-0.5 h-8 w-8 rounded-full" style="transform: none;"></div><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Code" aria-pressed="true" class="relative flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center transition-colors text-token-text-primary group-hover:text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#00f12a" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Preview" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" class="relative flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center transition-colors text-token-text-secondary group-hover:text-token-text-secondary hover:text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼu">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;head&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>Chef Daddy Ray's</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/title&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;body</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">style</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"</span><span>font-family: </span><span class="ͼy">Arial</span><span>; text-align:</span><span class="ͼy">center</span><span>; padding:</span><span class="ͼy">50</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>; background:#081a3a; color:</span><span class="ͼy">white</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼz">"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>🔥 Chef Daddy Ray's</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Life is too short for boring food.</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Website is live ✅</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/body&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="988" data-end="1009">Click <strong data-start="994" data-end="1009">File → Save</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1011" data-end="1014">
<h2 data-section-id="fr820l" data-start="1016" data-end="1048">🟢 Step 4 — Upload to Netlify</h2>
<ol data-start="1050" data-end="1148">
<li data-section-id="1pri3n0" data-start="1050" data-end="1066">
<p data-start="1053" data-end="1066">Go to Netlify</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1r10hhb" data-start="1067" data-end="1095">
<p data-start="1070" data-end="1095">Click <strong data-start="1076" data-end="1095">Add new project</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qxsx76" data-start="1096" data-end="1124">
<p data-start="1099" data-end="1124">Click <strong data-start="1105" data-end="1124">Deploy manually</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1u6jds1" data-start="1125" data-end="1148">
<p data-start="1128" data-end="1148">Drag ONLY this file:</p>
