<p data-start="76" data-end="174">So we’re going to <strong data-start="94" data-end="125">completely bypass downloads</strong> and do this the easiest, guaranteed-working way:</p>
<hr data-start="176" data-end="179">
<h1 data-section-id="qp16sx" data-start="181" data-end="220">✅ NO DOWNLOAD METHOD (this WILL work)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="n1alvo" data-start="222" data-end="258">Step 1 — Create the file yourself</h2>
<ol data-start="260" data-end="317">
<li data-section-id="fo4mwb" data-start="260" data-end="284">
<p data-start="263" data-end="284">Right-click Desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xg3l57" data-start="285" data-end="317">
<p data-start="288" data-end="317">Click <strong data-start="294" data-end="317">New → Text Document</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="319" data-end="330">You’ll see:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="331" data-end="360"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>New Text Document.txt</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="362" data-end="365">
<h2 data-section-id="1uitc8r" data-start="367" data-end="400">Step 2 — Rename it (IMPORTANT)</h2>
<ol data-start="402" data-end="444">
<li data-section-id="19mzfff" data-start="402" data-end="427">
<p data-start="405" data-end="427">Right-click → Rename</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="10453nn" data-start="428" data-end="444">
<p data-start="431" data-end="444">Change it to:</p>
</li>
</ol>
