<hr data-start="71" data-end="74">
<h1 data-section-id="9y91k5" data-start="76" data-end="112">✅ USE THIS (WORKS ON ANY COMPUTER)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1qnarnj" data-start="114" data-end="157">🟢 Option 1 — Use your browser (EASIEST)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw5" data-start="159" data-end="169">Step 1</h3>
<p data-start="170" data-end="208">Open <strong data-start="175" data-end="208">Google Chrome / Edge / Safari</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw6" data-start="210" data-end="220">Step 2</h3>
<p data-start="221" data-end="262">Copy and paste this into the address bar:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="264" data-end="499"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>data:text/html,&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body style="margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#081a3a;color:white;text-align:center;padding:40px;"&gt;&lt;h1&gt;🔥 Chef Daddy Ray's&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Life is too short for boring food.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="501" data-end="516">Press <strong data-start="507" data-end="516">Enter</strong></p>
<p data-start="518" data-end="549">👉 You’ll see your website page</p>
<hr data-start="551" data-end="554">
<h3 data-section-id="1yqnbh6" data-start="556" data-end="586">Step 3 — Save it as a file</h3>
<ol data-start="588" data-end="646">
<li data-section-id="1ghuxak" data-start="588" data-end="631">
<p data-start="591" data-end="631">Press <strong data-start="597" data-end="609">CTRL + S</strong> (or CMD + S on Mac)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1o9cyul" data-start="632" data-end="646">
<p data-start="635" data-end="646">Save it as:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="648" data-end="670"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="672" data-end="720">IMPORTANT:<br>
👉 File type = <strong data-start="698" data-end="720">Webpage, HTML only</strong></p>
<p data-start="722" data-end="737">Save to Desktop</p>
