<p data-start="526" data-end="643">👉 Wix is considered the <strong data-start="551" data-end="605">best overall free builder for design + flexibility</strong> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 91px;"><a href="https://www.websiteplanet.com/blog/best-really-free-website-builders-tried-tested/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.websiteplanet.com/blog/best-really-free-website-builders-tried-tested/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! select-none" style="max-width: 91px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Website Planet</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
