1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="192">I can’t literally log into Wix and build it for you, but I <em data-start="59" data-end="64">can</em> walk you through it so you get the exact Chef Daddy Ray’s site we’ve been designing — and it’ll take you about 10–15 minutes 👍</p>
<hr data-start="194" data-end="197">
<h1 data-section-id="1difecc" data-start="199" data-end="222">🔥 STEP 1 — Go to Wix</h1>
<p data-start="223" data-end="281">👉 Go to: <a data-start="233" data-end="252" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://www.wix.com/">https://www.wix.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a><br data-start="252" data-end="255">
👉 Click <strong data-start="264" data-end="281">“Get Started”</strong></p>
<ul data-start="283" data-end="312">
<li data-section-id="1kdqzte" data-start="283" data-end="312">
<p data-start="285" data-end="312">Sign in (Google is easiest)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="314" data-end="317">
<h1 data-section-id="1ad38kq" data-start="319" data-end="352">🔥 STEP 2 — Choose how to build</h1>
<p data-start="354" data-end="367">Wix will ask:</p>
<p data-start="369" data-end="414">👉 <strong data-start="372" data-end="414">“How do you want to create your site?”</strong></p>
<p data-start="416" data-end="450">👉 Click:<br>
<strong data-start="426" data-end="450">“Start from Scratch”</strong></p>
<p data-start="452" data-end="500">Then:<br>
👉 Choose <strong data-start="468" data-end="500">Business → Restaurant / Food</strong></p>
<hr data-start="502" data-end="505">
<h1 data-section-id="1m8zfaj" data-start="507" data-end="536">🔥 STEP 3 — Pick a template</h1>
<p data-start="538" data-end="585">Search:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="549" data-end="565">“Food Truck”</strong> or <strong data-start="569" data-end="585">“Restaurant”</strong></p>
<p data-start="587" data-end="601">Pick one with:</p>
<ul data-start="602" data-end="649">
<li data-section-id="1d34ndm" data-start="602" data-end="619">
<p data-start="604" data-end="619">Dark background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mcarcp" data-start="620" data-end="637">
<p data-start="622" data-end="637">Big food photos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tfzets" data-start="638" data-end="649">
<p data-start="640" data-end="649">Bold text</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="651" data-end="701">👉 Don’t overthink it — we’ll customize everything</p>
<hr data-start="703" data-end="706">
<h1 data-section-id="1fs4xad" data-start="708" data-end="756">🔥 STEP 4 — Build your Chef Daddy Ray’s layout</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="gjw8qb" data-start="758" data-end="786">🟦 SECTION 1 (Top / Hero)</h2>
<p data-start="788" data-end="801">Edit the top:</p>
<p data-start="803" data-end="813"><strong data-start="803" data-end="813">Title:</strong></p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="814" data-end="838"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Chef Daddy Ray’s</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="840" data-end="853"><strong data-start="840" data-end="853">Subtitle:</strong></p>
