tline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6951abdb-8df3-4c8d-adf0-e2bf20828e75" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="118">Perfect — let’s turn your Wix site into a <strong data-start="42" data-end="93">🔥 Chef Daddy Ray’s level food truck brand site</strong> (not just a basic menu).</p>
<p data-start="120" data-end="185">I’ll guide you step-by-step so it looks like your truck design 👇</p>
<hr data-start="187" data-end="190">
<h1 data-section-id="k8bzz0" data-start="192" data-end="206">🔥 GOAL LOOK</h1>
<p data-start="207" data-end="213">Think:</p>
<ul data-start="214" data-end="350">
<li data-section-id="ianaml" data-start="214" data-end="244">
<p data-start="216" data-end="244">Dark royal blue background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1hlwv7x" data-start="245" data-end="269">
<p data-start="247" data-end="269">Gold + flame accents</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2gaffg" data-start="270" data-end="294">
<p data-start="272" data-end="294">Big bold food photos</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1l9352c" data-start="295" data-end="318">
<p data-start="297" data-end="318">Clean menu sections</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="4iaw3g" data-start="319" data-end="350">
<p data-start="321" data-end="350">“Hot / premium / bold” vibe</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="352" data-end="355">
<h1 data-section-id="vcfh1h" data-start="357" data-end="403">🧱 STEP 1 — Fix your HEADER (most important)</h1>
<p data-start="405" data-end="435">Click your top section → Edit:</p>
