</li>
<li data-section-id="179dy9q" data-start="2099" data-end="2106">
<p data-start="2101" data-end="2106">Ranch</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="m5c5o5" data-start="2107" data-end="2120">
<p data-start="2109" data-end="2120">Daddy Sauce</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2122" data-end="2131">👉 Style:</p>
<ul data-start="2132" data-end="2185">
<li data-section-id="1d34ndm" data-start="2132" data-end="2149">
<p data-start="2134" data-end="2149">Dark background</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1e3p8jc" data-start="2150" data-end="2171">
<p data-start="2152" data-end="2171">White or gold pills</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15z0x70" data-start="2172" data-end="2185">
<p data-start="2174" data-end="2185">Glow effect</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2187" data-end="2190">
<h1 data-section-id="650set" data-start="2192" data-end="2230">📲 STEP 7 — CONTACT (MAKE IT STRONG)</h1>
<p data-start="2232" data-end="2254">Instead of plain text:</p>
<p data-start="2256" data-end="2277">Make <strong data-start="2261" data-end="2276">boxes/cards</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2279" data-end="2340">
<li data-section-id="1193uri" data-start="2279" data-end="2291">
<p data-start="2281" data-end="2291">📧 Email</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="6g71h1" data-start="2292" data-end="2308">
<p data-start="2294" data-end="2308">📸 Instagram</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1sxu29c" data-start="2309" data-end="2324">
<p data-start="2311" data-end="2324">👍 Facebook</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xmj4yt" data-start="2325" data-end="2340">
<p data-start="2327" data-end="2340">📍 Location</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2342" data-end="2349">👉 Add:</p>
<ul data-start="2350" data-end="2381">
<li data-section-id="1vhdo6c" data-start="2350" data-end="2358">
<p data-start="2352" data-end="2358">Border</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="68uvhq" data-start="2359" data-end="2367">
<p data-start="2361" data-end="2367">Shadow</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1skr846" data-start="2368" data-end="2381">
<p data-start="2370" data-end="2381">Slight glow</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2383" data-end="2386">
<h1 data-section-id="12riibn" data-start="2388" data-end="2426">🔥 STEP 8 — ADD FIRE / ENERGY EFFECT</h1>
<p data-start="2428" data-end="2455">You can fake flame vibe by:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="c1flla" data-start="2457" data-end="2470">Option 1:</h3>
<p data-start="2471" data-end="2495">Add background gradient:</p>
<ul data-start="2496" data-end="2528">
<li data-section-id="11ldkb3" data-start="2496" data-end="2528">
<p data-start="2498" data-end="2528">Blue → red/orange glow corners</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="c1flpp" data-start="2530" data-end="2543">Option 2:</h3>
<p data-start="2544" data-end="2575">Upload flame texture image and:</p>
<ul data-start="2576" data-end="2601">
<li data-section-id="dlbxtq" data-start="2576" data-end="2601">
<p data-start="2578" data-end="2601">Lower opacity to 20–30%</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2603" data-end="2606">
<h1 data-section-id="1pobfdk" data-start="2608" data-end="2651">🔥 STEP 9 — MOBILE CHECK (VERY IMPORTANT)</h1>
<p data-start="2653" data-end="2678">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="2663" data-end="2678">Mobile View</strong></p>
<p data-start="2680" data-end="2684">Fix:</p>
<ul data-start="2685" data-end="2741">
<li data-section-id="4d4765" data-start="2685" data-end="2705">
<p data-start="2687" data-end="2705">Text size (bigger)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="eeab6v" data-start="2706" data-end="2724">
<p data-start="2708" data-end="2724">Buttons centered</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dfzeui" data-start="2725" data-end="2741">
<p data-start="2727" data-end="2741">No overlapping</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2743" data-end="2746">
<h1 data-section-id="1irzimz" data-start="2748" data-end="2785">💡 PRO TIP (this makes it look pro)</h1>
<p data-start="2787" data-end="2796">Use ONLY:</p>
<ul data-start="2797" data-end="2867">
