e:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="d284dc6b-20cb-433b-b135-f712d29c95f0" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="89">Got you — this is a super common Wix issue. It’s not you, it’s how Wix handles uploads 👍</p>
<p data-start="91" data-end="111">Let’s fix it fast 👇</p>
<hr data-start="113" data-end="116">
<h1 data-section-id="uahelx" data-start="118" data-end="146">🔧 WHY DRAGGING IS FAILING</h1>
<p data-start="147" data-end="173">Usually it’s one of these:</p>
<ul data-start="174" data-end="329">
<li data-section-id="6sygl2" data-start="174" data-end="227">
<p data-start="176" data-end="227">You’re dragging from a <strong data-start="199" data-end="227">zip or downloads preview</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lw6oid" data-start="228" data-end="249">
<p data-start="230" data-end="249">The file is too big</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pwcdsf" data-start="250" data-end="291">
<p data-start="252" data-end="291">Wix editor didn’t load the upload panel</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3oqhc3" data-start="292" data-end="329">
<p data-start="294" data-end="329">You’re dragging into the wrong area</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="331" data-end="334">
<h1 data-section-id="1jcf6p7" data-start="336" data-end="361">✅ BEST WAY (WORKS 100%)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="18tfvwu" data-start="363" data-end="396">🔥 DO THIS INSTEAD OF DRAGGING</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw5" data-start="398" data-end="408">Step 1</h3>
<p data-start="409" data-end="423">In Wix editor:</p>
<p data-start="425" data-end="466">👉 Click <strong data-start="434" data-end="454">“+ Add Elements”</strong> (left side)</p>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw6" data-start="468" data-end="478">Step 2</h3>
<p data-start="479" data-end="498">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="489" data-end="498">Image</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw7" data-start="500" data-end="510">Step 3</h3>
<p data-start="511" data-end="537">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="521" data-end="537">Upload Media</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="onaaw0" data-start="539" data-end="549">Step 4</h3>
<p data-start="550" data-end="584">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="560" data-end="584">Upload from Computer</strong></p>
<p data-start="586" data-end="612">👉 Then select your photos</p>
<hr data-start="614" data-end="617">
<h1 data-section-id="r1onfa" data-start="619" data-end="647">💡 IMPORTANT (THIS IS KEY)</h1>
<p data-start="649" data-end="665">Don’t drag from:</p>
<ul data-start="666" data-end="712">
<li data-section-id="1awwbu8" data-start="666" data-end="685">
<p data-start="668" data-end="685">your ZIP file ❌</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="bbgvub" data-start="686" data-end="712">
<p data-start="688" data-end="712">your browser preview ❌</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="714" data-end="732">👉 Only drag from:</p>
<ul data-start="733" data-end="763">
<li data-section-id="1nrxhp6" data-start="733" data-end="742">
<p data-start="735" data-end="742">Desktop</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="qr9vu9" data-start="743" data-end="763">
<p data-start="745" data-end="763">or a normal folder</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="765" data-end="768">
<h1 data-section-id="1o0iunl" data-start="770" data-end="800">🔥 EVEN EASIER (BEST METHOD)</h1>
<h3 data-section-id="hn279w" data-start="802" data-end="827">Use Wix Media Manager</h3>
<ol data-start="829" data-end="924">
<li data-section-id="s8nnpt" data-start="829" data-end="859">
<p data-start="832" data-end="859">Click <strong data-start="838" data-end="847">Media</strong> (left side)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="sbpwy8" data-start="860" data-end="885">
<p data-start="863" data-end="885">Click <strong data-start="869" data-end="885">Upload Media</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13fa0xw" data-start="886" data-end="924">
<p data-start="889" data-end="924">Upload ALL your food photos at once</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="926" data-end="981">Then:<br>
👉 Drag them onto the page from the media library</p>
<hr data-start="983" data-end="986">
<h1 data-section-id="bf0rbx" data-start="988" data-end="1019">🚨 IF DRAG STILL DOESN’T WORK</h1>
<p data-start="1021" data-end="1030">Try this:</p>
<ul data-start="1031" data-end="1123">
<li data-section-id="kt9576" data-start="1031" data-end="1051">
<p data-start="1033" data-end="1051">Refresh Wix editor</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="19sgkvt" data-start="1052" data-end="1072">
<p data-start="1054" data-end="1072">Use Chrome browser</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ey5rww" data-start="1073" data-end="1099">
<p data-start="1075" data-end="1099">Turn off pop-up blockers</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1nq98bc" data-start="1100" data-end="1123">
<p data-start="1102" data-end="1123">Log out → log back in</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1125" data-end="1128">
<h1 data-section-id="slbgzi" data-start="1130" data-end="1158">🔥 PRO TIP (for your site)</h1>
<p data-start="1160" data-end="1189">Upload THESE types of images:</p>
<ul data-start="1190" data-end="1291">
<li data-section-id="1q4gn2j" data-start="1190" data-end="1212">
<p data-start="1192" data-end="1212">Burger close-up 🍔</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hy5pwc" data-start="1213" data-end="1231">
<p data-start="1215" data-end="1231">Tacos plate 🌮</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uczln1" data-start="1232" data-end="1251">
<p data-start="1234" data-end="1251">Wings basket 🍗</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16tf6v" data-start="1252" data-end="1271">
<p data-start="1254" data-end="1271">Loaded fries 🍟</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="b8qsma" data-start="1272" data-end="1291">
