<hr data-start="226" data-end="229">
<h1 data-section-id="1eoqg5y" data-start="231" data-end="268">🔥 EASIER + BETTER OPTION (for YOU)</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="16niguh" data-start="270" data-end="320">👉 Go back to your Netlify site (what we built)</h2>
<p data-start="322" data-end="370">Why this is actually better for your food truck:</p>
<ul data-start="371" data-end="532">
<li data-section-id="1srwabs" data-start="371" data-end="401">
<p data-start="373" data-end="401">You already got it working ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pq5ml" data-start="402" data-end="438">
<p data-start="404" data-end="438">Looks cleaner than Wix templates ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9gfh0g" data-start="439" data-end="490">
<p data-start="441" data-end="490">Loads faster on phones (important for QR codes) ✅</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="172ba3m" data-start="491" data-end="532">
<p data-start="493" data-end="532">You don’t fight the editor every time ✅</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="534" data-end="537">
<h1 data-section-id="1s9acs9" data-start="539" data-end="588">✏️ How you edit your menu (WAY easier than Wix)</h1>
<p data-start="590" data-end="614">You don’t drag anything.</p>
