<p data-start="2010" data-end="2034">Got your ZIP working ✅</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2036" data-end="2070">👉 You just need a <strong data-start="2055" data-end="2070">better host</strong></p>
<hr data-start="2072" data-end="2075">
<h1 data-section-id="t1y7xy" data-start="2077" data-end="2093">👍 If you want</h1>
<p data-start="2095" data-end="2101">I can:</p>
<ul data-start="2102" data-end="2247">
<li data-section-id="ewmgmv" data-start="2102" data-end="2152">
<p data-start="2104" data-end="2152">Walk you through Cloudflare Pages step-by-step</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1gy5lq8" data-start="2153" data-end="2201">
<p data-start="2155" data-end="2201">Set it up exactly like your Netlify workflow</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="mzf15q" data-start="2202" data-end="2247">
<p data-start="2204" data-end="2247">Make sure your ZIP uploads work perfectly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2249" data-end="2299">Just say:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="2262" data-end="2299">“set up cloudflare pages with me”</strong></p>
<p data-start="2301" data-end="2324">and we’ll lock it in 🔥</p>
