p-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="122">Perfect — Render is a great choice for what you’re doing. It works very similar to Netlify, just a little different setup.</p>
<p data-start="124" data-end="209">I’m going to walk you through this <strong data-start="159" data-end="206">step-by-step so it actually works first try</strong> 👍</p>
<hr data-start="211" data-end="214">
<h1 data-section-id="1807e0r" data-start="216" data-end="225">🔥 GOAL</h1>
<p data-start="226" data-end="311">👉 Upload your <code data-start="241" data-end="253">index.html</code> site<br data-start="258" data-end="261">
👉 Get a live link<br data-start="279" data-end="282">
👉 Be able to update easily</p>
<hr data-start="313" data-end="316">
<h1 data-section-id="1y2mqxh" data-start="318" data-end="344">🚀 STEP 1 — Go to Render</h1>
<p data-start="346" data-end="394">👉 <a data-start="349" data-end="367" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://render.com/">https://render.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a><br data-start="367" data-end="370">
👉 Click <strong data-start="379" data-end="394">Get Started</strong></p>
<p data-start="396" data-end="409">Sign in with:</p>
<ul data-start="410" data-end="428">
<li data-section-id="1wq4xx8" data-start="410" data-end="428">
<p data-start="412" data-end="428">Google (easiest)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="430" data-end="433">
<h1 data-section-id="5e5z5l" data-start="435" data-end="469">🚀 STEP 2 — Create a Static Site</h1>
<p data-start="471" data-end="486">Once logged in:</p>
<p data-start="488" data-end="548">👉 Click:<br>
<strong data-start="498" data-end="521">“New +” (top right)</strong><br data-start="521" data-end="524">
Then:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="533" data-end="548">Static Site</strong></p>
<hr data-start="550" data-end="553">
<h1 data-section-id="1imwffi" data-start="555" data-end="595">🚀 STEP 3 — Connect a repo (IMPORTANT)</h1>
<p data-start="597" data-end="643">Render does NOT allow drag &amp; drop like Netlify</p>
<p data-start="645" data-end="676">👉 You need GitHub (super easy)</p>
<hr data-start="678" data-end="681">
<h2 data-section-id="10s6c28" data-start="683" data-end="720">🔧 QUICK GITHUB SETUP (don’t skip)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1arsmpd" data-start="722" data-end="737">1. Go here:</h3>
<p data-start="738" data-end="759">👉 <a data-start="741" data-end="759" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://github.com/">https://github.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<h3 data-section-id="15obooe" data-start="761" data-end="774">2. Click:</h3>
<p data-start="775" data-end="796">👉 <strong data-start="778" data-end="796">New Repository</strong></p>
<p data-start="798" data-end="806">Name it:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="807" data-end="839"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>chef-daddy-rays</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="841" data-end="880">👉 Make it PUBLIC<br data-start="858" data-end="861">
👉 Click <strong data-start="870" data-end="880">Create</strong></p>
<hr data-start="882" data-end="885">
<h3 data-section-id="1bm2fmc" data-start="887" data-end="918">3. Upload your website file</h3>
<p data-start="920" data-end="957">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="930" data-end="957">Add file → Upload files</strong></p>
<p data-start="959" data-end="974">Drag your file:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="975" data-end="1002"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1004" data-end="1032">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="1014" data-end="1032">Commit changes</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1034" data-end="1037">
<h1 data-section-id="1pgh8ab" data-start="1039" data-end="1067">🚀 STEP 4 — Back to Render</h1>
<p data-start="1069" data-end="1073">Now:</p>
<p data-start="1075" data-end="1102">👉 Click <strong data-start="1084" data-end="1102">Connect GitHub</strong></p>
<p data-start="1104" data-end="1111">Select:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1112" data-end="1144"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>chef-daddy-rays</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1146" data-end="1149">
<h1 data-section-id="53bfu3" data-start="1151" data-end="1179">🚀 STEP 5 — Configure site</h1>
<p data-start="1181" data-end="1202">Fill this in EXACTLY:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="6zy2cb" data-start="1204" data-end="1213">Name:</h3>
