<h1 data-section-id="1sorn3b" data-start="1563" data-end="1591">🔄 HOW TO UPDATE YOUR MENU</h1>
<p data-start="1593" data-end="1621">Any time you want to update:</p>
<ol data-start="1623" data-end="1739">
<li data-section-id="1ryxh2k" data-start="1623" data-end="1640">
