<h1 data-section-id="17kqorn" data-start="130" data-end="174">🔥 FIX STEP 3 (UPLOAD YOUR FILE TO GITHUB)</h1>
<p data-start="176" data-end="232">You’re here:<br>
👉 Inside your new repo (<code data-start="214" data-end="231">chef-daddy-rays</code>)</p>
<hr data-start="234" data-end="237">
<h2 data-section-id="esj3zq" data-start="239" data-end="264">✅ LOOK FOR THIS SCREEN</h2>
<p data-start="266" data-end="296">You should see something like:</p>
<p data-start="298" data-end="323">👉 <strong data-start="301" data-end="323">“Quick setup” page</strong></p>
<p data-start="325" data-end="337">Now do THIS:</p>
<hr data-start="339" data-end="342">
<h2 data-section-id="1px4jw6" data-start="344" data-end="394">🟢 OPTION A (MOST COMMON — what you should see)</h2>
<p data-start="396" data-end="414">Click this button:</p>
<p data-start="416" data-end="451">👉 <strong data-start="419" data-end="451">“uploading an existing file”</strong></p>
<p data-start="453" data-end="496">(it’s small text in the middle of the page)</p>
