<p data-start="583" data-end="625">Click it → then click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="609" data-end="625">Upload files</strong></p>
<hr data-start="627" data-end="630">
<h2 data-section-id="91hpxp" data-start="632" data-end="648">🚀 NOW UPLOAD</h2>
<ol data-start="650" data-end="668">
<li data-section-id="1cb384n" data-start="650" data-end="668">
<p data-start="653" data-end="668">Drag your file:</p>
</li>
</ol>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="669" data-end="691"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="693" data-end="727">OR click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="706" data-end="727">choose your files</strong></p>
<hr data-start="729" data-end="732">
<h2 data-section-id="11anmm2" data-start="734" data-end="747">💾 SAVE IT</h2>
