<hr data-start="47" data-end="50">
<h1 data-section-id="1b4qbk7" data-start="52" data-end="87">🔥 HOW TO GET BACK TO YOUR GITHUB</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1dne2vd" data-start="89" data-end="106">🟢 EASIEST WAY</h2>
<p data-start="108" data-end="142">👉 Go here:<br>
<strong data-start="120" data-end="142"><a data-start="122" data-end="140" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://github.com/">https://github.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></strong></p>
<hr data-start="144" data-end="147">
<h2 data-section-id="15sjmz1" data-start="149" data-end="159">🟢 THEN</h2>
<ol data-start="161" data-end="251">
<li data-section-id="rzdl0q" data-start="161" data-end="195">
<p data-start="164" data-end="195">Click <strong data-start="170" data-end="181">Sign in</strong> (top right)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1uzvou6" data-start="196" data-end="251">
<p data-start="199" data-end="251">Use the same login you used before (Google or email)</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="253" data-end="256">
<h2 data-section-id="wv7ec5" data-start="258" data-end="285">🟢 ONCE YOU’RE LOGGED IN</h2>
<p data-start="287" data-end="313">You’ll see your dashboard.</p>
<p data-start="315" data-end="319">Now:</p>
<p data-start="321" data-end="398">👉 Click your profile picture (top right)<br data-start="362" data-end="365">
👉 Click:<br>
<strong data-start="375" data-end="398">“Your repositories”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="400" data-end="403">
<h2 data-section-id="rxns8r" data-start="405" data-end="428">🟢 FIND YOUR PROJECT</h2>
<p data-start="430" data-end="436">Click:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="437" data-end="474"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>chef-daddy-rays</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="476" data-end="479">
<h1 data-section-id="1jiw7jx" data-start="481" data-end="497">🚀 YOU’RE BACK</h1>
<p data-start="499" data-end="538">Now you should see your repo page again</p>
<hr data-start="540" data-end="543">
<h1 data-section-id="7j0e6s" data-start="545" data-end="569">🔥 IF YOU DON’T SEE IT</h1>
<p data-start="571" data-end="592">Try this direct link:</p>
<p data-start="594" data-end="647">👉 <a data-start="597" data-end="645" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link cursor-pointer">https://github.com/your-username/chef-daddy-rays<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></p>
<p data-start="649" data-end="696">(Replace <code data-start="658" data-end="673">your-username</code> with your GitHub name)</p>
<hr data-start="698" data-end="701">
<h1 data-section-id="nkoxz4" data-start="703" data-end="729">👍 IF YOU’RE STILL STUCK</h1>
