<hr data-start="3794" data-end="3797">
<h1 data-section-id="1yd9wor" data-start="3799" data-end="3827">🚀 HOW TO UPDATE YOUR SITE</h1>
<ol data-start="3829" data-end="3970">
<li data-section-id="1ryxh2k" data-start="3829" data-end="3846">
<p data-start="3832" data-end="3846">Go to GitHub</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1fq5oow" data-start="3847" data-end="3869">
<p data-start="3850" data-end="3869">Open <code data-start="3855" data-end="3867">index.html</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hu43pm" data-start="3870" data-end="3888">
<p data-start="3873" data-end="3888">Click ✏️ edit</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="7schtd" data-start="3889" data-end="3916">
<p data-start="3892" data-end="3916">Find your menu section</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="hi89hn" data-start="3917" data-end="3942">
<p data-start="3920" data-end="3942">Replace it with this</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="18sa0l3" data-start="3943" data-end="3970">
<p data-start="3946" data-end="3970">Click <strong data-start="3952" data-end="3970">Commit changes</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="3972" data-end="4007">👉 Render will update automatically</p>
<hr data-start="4009" data-end="4012">
