<hr data-start="3593" data-end="3596">
<h1 data-section-id="1x5wlr7" data-start="3598" data-end="3621">🔥 WHAT THIS JUST DID</h1>
<p data-start="3623" data-end="3637">Your menu now:</p>
<ul data-start="3638" data-end="3783">
<li data-section-id="169bm3g" data-start="3638" data-end="3683">
<p data-start="3640" data-end="3683">Looks like a <strong data-start="3653" data-end="3683">real food truck menu board</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="jrpri4" data-start="3684" data-end="3716">
<p data-start="3686" data-end="3716">Highlights your <strong data-start="3702" data-end="3716">best items</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="njzpha" data-start="3717" data-end="3746">
<p data-start="3719" data-end="3746">Is easier to scan on mobile</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1d082nt" data-start="3747" data-end="3783">
<p data-start="3749" data-end="3783">Feels <strong data-start="3755" data-end="3783">premium instead of basic</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3785" data-end="3788">
<h1 data-section-id="99twr" data-start="3790" data-end="3819">🚀 NEXT LEVEL (if you want)</h1>
