<hr data-start="1041" data-end="1044">
<h1 data-section-id="1gxrt6j" data-start="1046" data-end="1083">🚨 IF YOU DON’T SEE A STYLE SECTION</h1>
<p data-start="1085" data-end="1134">Tell me and I’ll:<br>
👉 add one for you (super easy)</p>
<hr data-start="1136" data-end="1139">
<h1 data-section-id="gcpsgd" data-start="1141" data-end="1162">👍 AFTER YOU ADD IT</h1>
<p data-start="1164" data-end="1192">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="1174" data-end="1192">Commit changes</strong></p>
<p data-start="1194" data-end="1227">Then:<br>
👉 Refresh your Render site</p>
<hr data-start="1229" data-end="1232">
<h1 data-section-id="1ez85n8" data-start="1234" data-end="1257">🔥 What you’ll notice</h1>
<ul data-start="1259" data-end="1339">
<li data-section-id="1r73oaw" data-start="1259" data-end="1290">
<p data-start="1261" data-end="1290">Cards “lift” when you hover</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1ylfbyo" data-start="1291" data-end="1311">
<p data-start="1293" data-end="1311">Prices glow more</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xg3gw1" data-start="1312" data-end="1339">
<p data-start="1314" data-end="1339">Menu looks more premium</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1341" data-end="1344">
<p data-start="1346" data-end="1462">If you want next:<br>
👉 I can show you how to make <strong data-start="1394" data-end="1447">sections look like your actual printed menu board</strong> (even cleaner)</p>
<p data-start="1464" data-end="1514" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Just say:<br>
