<p data-start="1338" data-end="1359">Wait ~10–20 seconds</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3hb5rp" data-start="1360" data-end="1389">
<p data-start="1363" data-end="1389">Refresh your Render site</p>
</li>
</ol>
