 flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="63">Great question — this is exactly where people get tripped up 👍</p>
<p data-start="65" data-end="198">👉 <strong data-start="68" data-end="85">Short answer:</strong><br data-start="85" data-end="88">
No, you do NOT put the image inside the code box.<br data-start="137" data-end="140">
You need to upload it as a <strong data-start="167" data-end="184">separate file</strong> in your repo.</p>
<hr data-start="200" data-end="203">
<h1 data-section-id="1h9qv0t" data-start="205" data-end="237">🔥 HOW TO DO IT (SUPER SIMPLE)</h1>
<p data-start="239" data-end="274">You already have:<br>
👉 <code data-start="260" data-end="272">index.html</code> ✅</p>
<p data-start="276" data-end="310">Now you need to add:<br>
👉 <code data-start="300" data-end="310">menu.png</code></p>
<hr data-start="312" data-end="315">
<h2 data-section-id="1ee4faf" data-start="317" data-end="347">🟢 STEP 1 — Go to your repo</h2>
<p data-start="349" data-end="376">👉 Open:<br>
<code data-start="358" data-end="376">Chef-Daddy_Ray-s</code></p>
<hr data-start="378" data-end="381">
<h2 data-section-id="1ur8a1f" data-start="383" data-end="414">🟢 STEP 2 — Upload the image</h2>
<p data-start="416" data-end="450">Click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="426" data-end="438">Add file</strong> (top right)</p>
<p data-start="452" data-end="477">Then:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="461" data-end="477">Upload files</strong></p>
<hr data-start="479" data-end="482">
<h2 data-section-id="f53ppl" data-start="484" data-end="521">🟢 STEP 3 — Upload your menu image</h2>
<p data-start="523" data-end="583">Drag your image file in<br data-start="546" data-end="549">
OR click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="562" data-end="583">choose your files</strong></p>
<hr data-start="585" data-end="588">
<h2 data-section-id="o2dqjy" data-start="590" data-end="614">🟢 STEP 4 — IMPORTANT</h2>
<p data-start="616" data-end="651">Make sure the file name is EXACTLY:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="653" data-end="673"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>menu.png</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="675" data-end="702">(no spaces, no extra words)</p>
<hr data-start="704" data-end="707">
<h2 data-section-id="1pmmcwl" data-start="709" data-end="731">🟢 STEP 5 — Save it</h2>
<p data-start="733" data-end="777">Scroll down and click:<br>
