<hr data-start="50" data-end="53">
<h1 data-section-id="1abeoys" data-start="55" data-end="90">🔥 HOW TO GET TO YOUR GITHUB REPO</h1>
<h2 data-section-id="1hc2kor" data-start="92" data-end="119">🟢 STEP 1 — Go to GitHub</h2>
<p data-start="121" data-end="161">👉 Click or type:<br>
<strong data-start="139" data-end="161"><a data-start="141" data-end="159" rel="noopener" target="_new" class="decorated-link" href="https://github.com/">https://github.com<span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" data-rtl-flip="" class="block h-[0.75em] w-[0.75em] stroke-current stroke-[0.75]"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#304883" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></a></strong></p>
<hr data-start="163" data-end="166">
<h2 data-section-id="1m4gv7e" data-start="168" data-end="190">🟢 STEP 2 — Sign in</h2>
<p data-start="192" data-end="196">Use:</p>
<ul data-start="197" data-end="249">
<li data-section-id="1ccc2ro" data-start="197" data-end="223">
<p data-start="199" data-end="223">your Google login<br data-start="216" data-end="219">
OR</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1cbg0zl" data-start="224" data-end="249">
<p data-start="226" data-end="249">your email + password</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="251" data-end="254">
<h2 data-section-id="1d9gi3t" data-start="256" data-end="294">🟢 STEP 3 — Go to your repositories</h2>
<p data-start="296" data-end="325">Look in the top right corner:</p>
<p data-start="327" data-end="360">👉 Click your <strong data-start="341" data-end="360">profile picture</strong></p>
<p data-start="362" data-end="400">Then click:<br>
👉 <strong data-start="377" data-end="400">“Your repositories”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="402" data-end="405">
<h2 data-section-id="1772gew" data-start="407" data-end="439">🟢 STEP 4 — Open your project</h2>
<p data-start="441" data-end="456">You should see:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="458" data-end="501"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Chef-Daddy_Ray-s</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="503" data-end="514">👉 Click it</p>
<hr data-start="516" data-end="519">
<h1 data-section-id="1k4ex08" data-start="521" data-end="538">🚀 YOU’RE THERE</h1>
<p data-start="540" data-end="575">Now you should see your files like:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="577" data-end="614"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-430d4e28.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>index.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="616" data-end="619">
<h1 data-section-id="otj8s7" data-start="621" data-end="647">🔥 SHORTCUT (FASTER WAY)</h1>
<p data-start="649" data-end="679">You can also go directly here:</p>
